MOVING                          LOOKING                               
j/k  ↑/↓     select a row       h  ?         this keymap              
g/G home/end first / last       b            feed, full screen        
J/K          next / prev sheep  F            gather by fold           
ctrl-d/u     page the feed      z            collapse a fold          
←/→          environment tab    o            out / err / both         
tab          next config group  m            minimum level            
1-8          jump to a group    f            follow the tail          
n/N          next / prev match  w            wrap long lines          
↵            open selection     /            filter, or match         
esc          back one level     r            refresh now              
                                v            reveal for 10s           
                                y            copy the value           
                                                                      
CHANGING                        DOING                                 
e            the config pane    x            stop                     
space        cycle a value      R            restart                  
d            restore default    L            reload                   
u            undo the edit                                            
s            shepherd settings                                        
S            secrets                                                  
D            delete a secret                                          
c            leave it running                                         
any char     types into a box                                         
⌫ ↵ esc      erase, file, drop                                        
                                                                      
                                                                      
                                                                      
 the three above each arm a confirm  ·  ↵ confirms  ·  10s to answer …
 colour is decoration only: every coloured cell says the same thing i…
 h or ?  closes this  ·  q  ctrl-c  quits lookout                     
                                                                      
                                                                      
                                                                      
                                                                      
